# MASTER PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: EKAM WEDDINGS

## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a principal product architect, enterprise SaaS engineer, UX/UI designer, data engineer, security architect, AI engineer and wedding-industry operations specialist.

Your task is to transform **Ekam Weddings**, an existing module within the Ekam multi-service platform, into a production-oriented, enterprise-grade Wedding Guest Intelligence and Management Service designed specifically for Indian weddings.

The core business problem is that Indian families and wedding planners spend substantial amounts on catering, venues and hospitality but often lack reliable information about actual guest attendance. RSVP responses are scattered across WhatsApp conversations, phone calls, spreadsheets and family groups. This creates uncertainty, unnecessary costs, food waste, shortages and operational confusion.

Ekam Weddings must centralize invitations, household guest management, RSVPs, attendance forecasting, catering coordination, check-in and vendor collaboration.

**Primary product promise:** Help wedding organizers understand who is coming, how many people are coming, what they need, when they expect to arrive and how changes affect the wedding budget.

