## 3. TARGET USERS AND ORGANIZATION MODEL

Support the following user types:

1. Wedding host or family administrator.
2. Wedding planner or event management agency.
3. Guest list manager or family coordinator.
4. Catering manager.
5. Venue manager.
6. Hospitality, transport and check-in staff.
7. Read-only client or vendor collaborator.
